									<p> </p><p><strong>Niki Yazdanian</strong> is Vice President, Global Brand Marketing at Carey International, bringing over 20 years’ experience in sales, marketing and business development across the luxury mobility, travel, property and hospitality sectors. She is recognised for building high-value partnerships, shaping brand strategy and driving sustained revenue growth.</p><p>Since joining Carey International in 2012, Niki has led national sales and brand initiatives, delivering consistent growth and strengthening Carey International’s position as the trusted partner for leading global corporations. Earlier in her career, Niki held senior sales roles at London Linen Supply, where she secured multi-site contracts with national hotel and restaurant chains, and at Sinclairs Estate Agency, where she marketed and sold high-value residential and commercial real estate across London.</p><p>Niki holds a BA (Hons) in Event Management and Marketing from Leeds Beckett University and graduated with First Class Honours. She is fluent in English and Persian.</p>								</div>
